expression 'Sample File (2)' = ```
		let
		    // Read all PDF files from the specified folder
		    SourceFolder = Folder.Files("C:\Users\berlin\Desktop\Expenses"),
		    
		    // Filter to include only PDF files (exclude folders and non-PDF files)
		    FilteredFiles = Table.SelectRows(SourceFolder, each [Extension] = ".pdf" and not [Attributes]?[Directory]?),
		    Navigation1 = FilteredFiles{13}[Content]
		in
		    Navigation1
		```
